    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Use this visitor to input raw data into model which is assumed to be ordered in input vector by variable components (for example vector v1x, v1y, v1z, v2x...) visitor will renumber elements or nodes.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>S. K. Matthai </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2006 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
